{%- comment -%}
  GLOWLING · BLOCK 07 · Side cart (slide-out cart drawer), works on every page
  PASTE INTO: Theme editor → Footer (section group) → Add section → Custom Liquid → paste this.
  THEN: Theme settings → Cart → Cart type → "Page" (so the theme's own drawer/popup doesn't open as well).
  If you use Kaching Bundles: set its "after add to cart" action to "Do nothing / stay on page".

  What it does:
  - Catches every add-to-cart (theme forms, and apps that call /cart/add.js) and opens the drawer
  - Header cart icon opens the drawer instead of the cart page
  - Quantity +/−, remove, free-shipping progress bar per currency, optional one-click upsell
  - Checkout button, guarantee line, payment icons
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign gl_cart_guarantee_days = 30 -%}
